+/// `--ask`'s question: the next word, which is not a flag. `--ask --json` has no question, and
+/// asking the model "--json" is not what was meant; a question that is a single dash is read from
+/// standard input, and one that starts with a single dash is still a question.
+fn ask_question(next: Option<String>) -> Result<String, String> {
+    match next {
+        Some(question) if question != "--json" => Ok(question),
+        _ => Err("--ask needs a question, or - to read it from standard input".to_string()),
+    }
+}
